OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,FFour men from Rhyl acted as a grooming
OL,7,Fgang - with three of them using two
OL,8,Fteenagers as "sexual playthings",
OL,9,Fplying them with drugs before passing
OL,10,Fthem around to sexually abuse.
OL,12,FAfter three months, jurors at
OL,13,FCaernarfon Crown Court found Mustafa
OL,14,FIqbal, 43, Mohamed Arshad, 36, and
OL,15,FZiaullah Badshah, 25, guilty of rape
OL,16,Fand that the vulnerable girls were
OL,17,Fsexually exploited by the three
OL,18,Ffriends.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/18
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,FIn addition, 61-year-old Jaswinder
OL,7,FSingh from Rhyl was found guilty for
OL,8,Fhis part in the conspiracy to traffic
OL,9,Fthe girls, who cannot be named, after
OL,10,Fhe took one to London and asked her to
OL,11,Fpretend to be his carer for fear his
OL,12,Fsister would think he was part of an
OL,13,F"Asian grooming gang".
OL,15,FFlintshire grandmother Sarah Gray has
OL,16,Fbeen found guilty of perverting the
OL,17,Fcause of justice, assisting an
OL,18,Foffender and conspiring to supply
OL,19,FClass A drugs.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/18
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,FIt was the prosecution's case that the
OL,7,Fmen knew the girls were underage even
OL,8,Fthough the teens had lied and claimed
OL,9,Fthey were 17. The defendants said this
OL,10,Fwas not true.
OL,12,FHowever, throughout the trial
OL,13,Fprosecutors argued that none of the
OL,14,Fdefendants investigated the girls'
OL,15,Fages and in the case of Iqbal and
OL,16,FArshad evidence was heard that they
OL,17,Flied about their own ages to appear
OL,18,Fyounger.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/18
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,FMustafa Iqbal, 43 spotted the two
OL,7,Fvictims, a 14-year-old referred to as
OL,8,FGirl C, and a 15-year-old called Girl
OL,9,FB, out in Rhyl on a spring evening in
OL,10,F2022.
OL,12,FDuring the trial at Caernarfon Crown
OL,13,FCourt, jurors heard Iqbal, a local
OL,14,Fdrug dealer and takeaway driver,
OL,15,Fpersuaded the pair to come to his home
OL,16,Fin the seaside town and called his
OL,17,Ffriends Badshah and Arshad, a Rhyl
OL,18,Fcafe owner, over.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/18
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,FJurors were told the two girls were
OL,7,Fplied with drink and cannabis and
OL,8,Fplayed spin the bottle.
OL,10,FIt was the prosecution's case that
OL,11,FMustafa Iqbal, who did not give
OL,12,Fevidence in his defence, quickly
OL,13,Fconcluded the pair were "ripe for
OL,14,Fsexual exploitation".
OL,16,FProsecuting barrister Owen Edwards KC
OL,17,Fsaid: "These men treated the girls as
OL,18,Fsexual commodities. They took full
OL,19,Fsexual advantage."
OL,26,@uD@YOUvD@TO]yD@GOU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/18
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,FHaving first met the girls, they took
OL,7,Ffull sexual advantage of Child B in
OL,8,Fparticular. Child C said she would
OL,9,Freluctantly accompany Child B in the
OL,10,Fvain hope of protecting her. Child C
OL,11,Fsaid Iqbal would abuse her while
OL,12,FArshad was with Child B and Badshah,
OL,13,Fshe said, attempted the same while
OL,14,Falso having sex with her friend.
OL,16,FIt was claimed the four men in the
OL,17,Fdock Mustafa Iqbal, Mohamed Arshad,
OL,18,FZiaullah Badshah and Jaswinder Singh
OL,19,Fwere "friends who shared details of
OL,20,Fwhat they could get the girls to do"
OL,21,Fin exchange for drugs.
OL,26,@{D@FOU|D@dO]
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G6/18
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,FIt was alleged the sexual exploitation
OL,7,Fand trafficking would have continued
OL,8,Fif it was not for a trip to London
OL,9,Fwith Jaswinder Singh, leading to
OL,10,Fpolice involvement.
OL,12,FSingh, 61, of River Street, Rhyl
OL,13,Fdenied any sexual contact with the
OL,14,Fgirls and pleaded not guilty to two
OL,15,Fcounts of conspiracy to traffic and
OL,16,Fsupplying cannabis to another.
OL,18,FArrests were made when Child B, a 15-
OL,19,Fyear-old, was taken to London by
OL,20,Fdefendant Jaswinder Singh and told to
OL,21,Fpretend to be his 22-year-old carer.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G7/18
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
