FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,FThe 61-year-old ordered her to do this
OL,7,F"to avoid his sister concluding he was
OL,8,Fpart of an Asian grooming gang", the
OL,9,Fcourt heard.
OL,11,FHowever, upon meeting Child B, another
OL,12,Fgirl quickly decided she needed
OL,13,Fprotection and the prosecution said
OL,14,F"her intervention and that of her
OL,15,Fmother got police involved".
OL,17,FAll four men were arrested and made
OL,18,Fvarious denials. They were not at that
OL,19,Fstage prosecuted.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@_O]vD@AOUwD@[O]
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G8/18
