OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,FIt was then, the court heard, that a
OL,7,Fthird alleged victim, Child A, was
OL,8,Fgroomed by Iqbal and used as a "sexual
OL,9,Fplaything". He would pick up the 16-
OL,10,Fyear-old who had been in a care
OL,11,Fsetting and she would hide in his car.
OL,13,FHowever she finally went public after
OL,14,Fbeing handcuffed by Iqbal and forced
OL,15,Fto have sex. It was her going to the
OL,16,Fpolice, which led to the prosecution
OL,17,Fof all five in the dock.
OL,26,@pD@`OUqD@JO]
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G9/18
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
