OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,FThe fifth defendant, 53-year-old Sarah
OL,7,FGray, of Gronant, Flintshire, was
OL,8,Faccused of allowing Iqbal to use her
OL,9,Fhome as a safe house to sexually
OL,10,Fexploit Child A. It was also claimed
OL,11,Fshe washed bedding following an
OL,12,Fallegation of rape. She has been found
OL,13,Fguilty of perverting the course of
OL,14,Fjustice, assisting an offender, and
OL,15,Fconspiracy to supply cocaine.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                  G10/18
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
