FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,FMustafa Iqbal was found guilty of four
OL,7,Fcounts of rape, three counts of sexual
OL,8,Fassault and three counts of inciting a
OL,9,Fchild aged under 16 to engage in
OL,10,Fsexual activity. He was also found
OL,11,Fguilty of several other offences,
OL,12,Fincluding six under the Modern Slavery
OL,13,FAct and conspiracy to supply Class A
OL,14,Fand Class B drugs.
OL,16,FMohamed Arshad from Clifton Grove,
OL,17,FRhyl, was found guilty of three
OL,18,Fcharges of rape, conspiracy to traffic
OL,19,Fand forced labour, and supplying
OL,20,Fcannabis to two girls aged 14 and 15.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                  G11/18
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43212
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,FDuring cross examination Arshad, who
OL,7,Fran Zayns Coffee House on Market
OL,8,FStreet in Rhyl told jurors at
OL,9,FCaernarfon Crown Court that he was
OL,10,F"disgusted" with himself when he found
OL,11,Fout he had kissed 15-year-old Child B.
OL,13,FIt was the defence's case that Arshad
OL,14,Fdid not initially know the ages of the
OL,15,Fgirls. However, the prosecution argued
OL,16,Fhe was well aware and they claim the
OL,17,Fmain defendant in the trial Mustafa
OL,18,FIqbal had lied to the teens and said
OL,19,Fthe men were 22 and 25.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@KO]
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                  G12/18
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43213
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,FWhen asked why Arshad did not
OL,7,Fimmediately correct Iqbal and tell the
OL,8,Fteens he was 32, he said "I don't know
OL,9,FSir. I should've corrected him."
OL,11,FMr Edwards KC said: "It's really pervy
OL,12,Ffor men in their thirties to invite
OL,13,Fgirls into their house . Far less
OL,14,Fpervy if 22 or 25. Not a couple of men
OL,15,Fwith cars and businesses taking
OL,16,Fadvantage of kids."
OL,26,@pD@ZOUqD@`O]sD@UOU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                  G13/18
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43214
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,FThe court heard Arshad had taken Child
OL,7,FB, with others, to Manchester in his
OL,8,Fcar. He told the jury: "If I'd known
OL,9,Fshe was only 15, I would never have
OL,10,Ftaken her in my car."
OL,12,FProsecuting barrister Owen Edwards KC
OL,13,Fsaid: "She told you she was 15 in your
OL,14,Fcar."
OL,16,F"No Sir, that's a lie," responded
OL,17,FArshad. Mr Edwards responded: "Your
OL,18,Fchoice - think about what you say. You
OL,19,Ftold her your real age in the car
OL,20,Fdidn't you?"
OL,26,@pD@XOUrD@UO]uD@GOUvD@EO]xD@AOUxD@WO]yD@
OL,26,A_OU|D@LO]
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                  G14/18
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43215
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,F"I possibly did," replied Arshad.
OL,8,FFellow defendant Ziaullah Badshah, now
OL,9,F25, moved to Rhyl from Pakistan 10
OL,10,Fyears ago. He left at the age of 15
OL,11,Fafter a family member was killed and
OL,12,Fhis home destroyed.
OL,14,FHe was evacuated to be with his
OL,15,Fbrother who lived in the seaside town.
OL,17,FHe admitted he had sex with 15-year-
OL,18,Fold Child B but claimed it was
OL,19,Fconsensual. He said he only discovered
OL,20,Fshe was 15 when she had gone to London
OL,21,Fwith co-defendant Jaswinder Singh.
OL,26,@nD@AOUnD@QO]
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                  G15/18
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43216
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,FBecoming tearful he told the jury:
OL,7,F"That was one of the worst
OL,8,Ftimes...it's something I would never
OL,9,Fdo...underage girls and dating them."
OL,11,FThroughout this trial, prosecutors
OL,12,Fhave read out text messages between
OL,13,Fthe defendants as they tried to prove
OL,14,Fthey were acting as a grooming gang.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                  G16/18
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43217
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,FIn April 2022 a photograph of Child B
OL,7,Fand Child C was captured on a mobile
OL,8,Fdevice belonging to Singh while at his
OL,9,Fresidence. A text message between
OL,10,FJaswinder Singh to Mohamed Arshad was
OL,11,Fread out in court: "Hi, thank you
OL,12,Fsoooo much but you have to charge
OL,13,Fme...business is business."
OL,15,FArshad maintains it is "ludicrous" to
OL,16,Fimply those communications concerned
OL,17,Fthe victims, claiming instead they
OL,18,Frelated to food orders from his
OL,19,Fbusiness.
OL,26,@sD@TOUuD@[O]wD@XOUwD@bO]
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                  G17/18
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43218
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785786508
OL,3,CGrooming gang found guilty of plying
OL,4,Cteenage girls with drugs for sex
OL,6,F"I'm not a person that sells bloody
OL,7,Fgirls," Arshad told the court.
OL,9,F"I was charging for food. It's
OL,10,Fludicrous to think I was charging for
OL,11,Fthe girls."
OL,13,FSentencing is scheduled to take place
OL,14,Fon 25 September at Caernarfon Crown
OL,15,FCourt.
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@GO]
